<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark"><title>Palm X · 屏幕进入现实 / 单镜头接入 v0.3</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#101114;--surface:#191b20;--line:#30343b;--text:#f5f5f7;--secondary:#b7bbc4;--muted:#969ba6;--brand:#6c3baa;--focus:#b99ae4}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{background:var(--bg);scroll-behavior:auto}body{margin:0;color:var(--text);background:var(--bg);font:400 16px/1.65 Manrope,"Noto Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer;color:inherit;touch-action:manipulation}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:4px}button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}.top{position:fixed;z-index:20;top:0;inset-inline:0;height:72px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:0 36px;background:#101114ed;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);gap:18px}.brand{font-size:22px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.04em}.edition{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--secondary);margin-left:22px}.top button,.ghost{border:1px solid #555b65;border-radius:8px;padding:8px 14px;min-height:44px;background:transparent;font-size:13px}.top .tools{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.asset-count{font-size:12px;color:var(--secondary);margin-right:4px}.track{height:520vh}.stage{position:sticky;top:0;height:100svh;min-height:560px;overflow:hidden;background:#101114}.media{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden}.media video,.media img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}.shade{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#101114b8,transparent 38%,transparent 68%,#101114c9),linear-gradient(90deg,#1011147a,transparent 28%,transparent 72%,#1011147a)}.missing{position:absolute;left:28%;right:28%;top:37%;bottom:28%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;border-block:1px solid #444952;background:#16181bb0;padding:28px}.missing .slot{font-size:12px;color:var(--secondary);letter-spacing:.12em}.missing h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:500;margin:12px 0}.missing p{font-size:13px;color:var(--secondary);max-width:400px;margin:0}.missing small{font-size:11px;margin-top:20px;color:var(--muted)}.copy{position:absolute;top:115px;left:4%;z-index:3;pointer-events:none;max-width:720px}.eyebrow{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--secondary)}h1{font-size:clamp(32px,3.9vw,54px);font-weight:500;line-height:1.17;letter-spacing:-.025em;white-space:pre-line;margin:15px 0}.copy p{font-size:14px;color:var(--secondary);max-width:650px;margin:0}.note{position:absolute;top:121px;right:4%;text-align:right;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);max-width:220px;z-index:3}.rail{position:absolute;top:39%;z-index:5;width:200px}.rail.left{left:4%}.rail.right{right:4%;width:240px}.rail-label{display:block;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--secondary);padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:7px}.option{border:0;border-left:2px solid transparent;width:100%;background:transparent;display:flex;gap:12px;padding:15px 10px;min-height:66px;align-items:center;text-align:left}.option[aria-pressed=true]{border-left-color:var(--focus);background:#191b20b0}.option b{display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:500}.option small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--secondary)}.option .check{margin-left:auto;color:var(--focus);visibility:hidden}.option[aria-pressed=true] .check{visibility:visible}.swatch{width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid #8c929c;flex-shrink:0}.wood{background:#9b7753}.metal{background:#9fa8b2}.project-number{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.micro{font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px}.actions{position:absolute;bottom:130px;left:28%;right:28%;text-align:center;z-index:6}.job{font-size:12px;color:var(--secondary);margin:0 0 12px}.primary{background:var(--brand);border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;min-height:48px;padding:12px 23px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:white}.primary:hover{background:#7948b8}.link-button{border:0;background:transparent;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;font-size:12px;min-height:44px;padding:8px 12px}.bar{height:2px;background:#555b6560;margin:12px auto 6px;max-width:360px}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--focus);width:0}.finished-message{font-size:15px;color:var(--text);margin:0 0 6px}.scroll-indicator{font-size:22px;color:var(--secondary);line-height:1.2}.film-controls{position:absolute;bottom:134px;right:4%;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;z-index:7}.film-controls small{font-size:11px;color:var(--secondary)}.film-controls .ghost{background:#101114aa}.steps{position:absolute;bottom:65px;inset-inline:4%;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:15px;gap:20px;z-index:8}.steps ol{display:flex;gap:28px;padding:0;margin:0;list-style:none;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.steps li[aria-current=step]{color:var(--text)}.steps li[aria-current=step] span{color:var(--focus)}.steps span{margin-right:8px;font-size:10px}.steps .hint{font-size:12px;color:var(--secondary)}.disclaimer{position:absolute;bottom:22px;inset-inline:4%;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);z-index:9;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px}.after{min-height:85svh;max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding:90px 36px 110px}.after h2{font-size:32px;line-height:1.4;font-weight:500;margin:12px 0 28px}.after .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px}.after article{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:18px}.after h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 12px}.after p{font-size:14px;color:var(--secondary);line-height:1.8}.after .tag{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);letter-spacing:.12em}dialog{width:min(900px,calc(100% - 32px));max-height:90svh;border:1px solid #555b65;background:#191b20;color:var(--text);padding:28px;border-radius:12px}dialog::backdrop{background:#000b}dialog h2{font-size:26px;font-weight:500;margin:0 0 12px}dialog p{font-size:13px;color:var(--secondary)}.dialog-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px}.dialog-top button{flex-shrink:0}.slots{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px;margin:20px 0}.slot-box{border:1px solid #50555e;padding:16px;border-radius:8px;min-width:0}.slot-box b{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;display:block;margin-bottom:6px}.slot-box code{font-size:11px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:var(--secondary)}.slot-box input{font-size:12px;width:100%;margin-top:14px}.slot-box small{display:block;font-size:11px;margin-top:9px;color:var(--muted);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.batch{padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13px}.batch input{font-size:12px;display:block;margin-top:10px;max-width:100%}.status{min-height:22px;font-size:12px;color:var(--focus)}.media-error{color:var(--secondary)}[hidden]{display:none!important}.toast{position:fixed;z-index:60;bottom:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);max-width:90vw;background:#23252b;border:1px solid #737985;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 18px;font-size:13px;box-shadow:0 8px 40px #0009}.media-mode .missing{display:none}
@media(max-width:1100px){.rail{width:160px}.rail.right{width:194px}.note{display:none}.missing{left:27%;right:27%;padding:18px}.missing h2{font-size:22px}.edition{font-size:10px}}
@media(max-width:760px){.top{height:64px;padding:0 18px}.edition,.asset-count{display:none}.top .tools{gap:7px}.top button{font-size:11px;padding:8px 10px;min-height:40px}.brand{font-size:21px}.stage{min-height:760px;height:100svh}.track{height:560vh}.copy{top:90px;left:22px;right:22px}.copy h1{font-size:30px}.copy p{font-size:12px;max-width:100%}.eyebrow{font-size:10px}.media{top:225px;height:calc(100% - 540px);min-height:190px;bottom:auto}.media video,.media img{object-fit:contain}.shade{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#101114b0,transparent 30%,transparent 65%,#101114cc)}.missing{top:240px;bottom:350px;left:22px;right:22px;padding:15px}.missing .slot{font-size:10px}.missing h2{font-size:20px;margin:8px 0}.missing p{font-size:11px}.missing small{font-size:10px;margin-top:12px}.rail.left{top:auto;bottom:264px;left:22px;right:22px;width:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}.rail.left .rail-label{font-size:10px;border:0;padding:0;margin:0 4px 0 0;white-space:nowrap}.rail.left .option{flex:1;width:auto;min-height:48px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;gap:7px}.rail.left .option[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:var(--focus)}.option b{font-size:12px}.option small{font-size:9px}.swatch{height:24px;width:24px}.rail.left .micro{display:none}.rail.left .option small{display:none}.rail.right{top:auto;bottom:190px;left:22px;right:22px;width:auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:7px}.rail.right .rail-label{display:none}.rail.right .option{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;min-height:62px}.rail.right .option[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:var(--focus)}.project-number{display:none}.actions{left:22px;right:22px;bottom:111px}.job{font-size:11px;margin-bottom:8px}.primary{font-size:12px;min-height:44px;padding:10px 16px}.steps{bottom:52px;left:22px;right:22px;gap:10px;padding-top:10px}.steps ol{gap:12px;font-size:10px}.steps span{margin-right:4px;font-size:9px}.steps .hint{font-size:10px;max-width:110px;text-align:right}.disclaimer{left:22px;right:22px;bottom:14px;font-size:9px}.disclaimer span:last-child{display:none}.film-controls{right:22px;left:22px;bottom:145px;justify-content:space-between}.film-controls small{font-size:10px;max-width:64%}.after{padding:64px 22px}.after h2{font-size:28px}.after .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.slots{grid-template-columns:1fr}dialog{padding:20px}dialog h2{font-size:22px}.finished-message{font-size:13px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}

/* v0.3: retain the uploaded frame, use its ending as a clearly labelled still. */
.media { inset:72px 0 116px; background:#101114; }
.media video,.media img {object-fit:contain;}
.shade {background:linear-gradient(180deg,#101114ed 0%,#1011148c 19%,transparent 37%,transparent 70%,#1011149c 89%,#101114 100%),linear-gradient(90deg,#101114c9 0%,#10111430 20%,transparent 34%,transparent 66%,#10111438 82%,#101114bd 100%);}
.copy {top:108px;max-width:560px;}
.copy h1 {font-size:clamp(32px,3.5vw,50px);}
.copy p {max-width:480px;}
.rail {top:38%;}
.rail.left,.rail.right {background:#101114e8;padding:18px 16px;border:1px solid #ffffff16;border-radius:8px;}
.rail.right {width:246px;}
.rail .option {padding-inline:7px;}
.rail .option:disabled {opacity:.5;}
.actions {bottom:131px;}
.actions .job {background:#101114e0;display:table;margin:0 auto 10px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:4px;}
.primary:disabled {background:#23252b;color:#b7bbc4;opacity:1;}
.note {top:112px;color:#b7bbc4;}
.missing {top:42%;bottom:27%;background:#101114ec;border-color:#555b65;}
.clip-meter {position:absolute;left:4%;right:4%;bottom:118px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;z-index:5;color:#b7bbc4;font-size:11px;}
.clip-meter .trackline {height:2px;background:#ffffff2e;flex:1;}
.clip-meter .trackline i {height:100%;width:0;display:block;background:#B99AE4;}
.clip-meter span {font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;}
.stage.phase-selection .copy h1 {font-size:40px;}
.stage.phase-selection .copy p {font-size:13px;}
.stage.phase-following .copy h1 {font-size:40px;}
.phase-selection .rail {animation:railIn 320ms ease-out both;}
@keyframes railIn {from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.phase-selection .rail{animation:none}}
.status-pill {display:inline-block;border:1px solid #5c626d;border-radius:4px;padding:4px 8px;font-size:10px;margin-top:12px;color:#b7bbc4;}
@media(max-width:1100px){.rail.right{width:205px}.rail.left,.rail.right{padding:14px 10px}.copy{max-width:440px}.copy p{max-width:430px}}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .stage{height:100svh;min-height:760px}.media{top:204px;left:0;right:0;bottom:336px;height:auto;min-height:0}
 .copy{top:87px;left:22px;right:22px;max-width:none}.copy h1,.stage.phase-selection .copy h1,.stage.phase-following .copy h1{font-size:28px;line-height:1.2;margin:10px 0}
 .copy p,.stage.phase-selection .copy p{font-size:11px;max-width:100%;line-height:1.6}.note{display:none}
 .rail.left,.rail.right{background:#101114;border:0;padding:0;border-radius:0}
 .rail.left{top:auto;bottom:269px;width:auto}.rail.right{top:auto;bottom:194px;width:auto;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}
 .rail.right .option{padding:8px 5px;display:block;min-height:65px}.rail.right .option b{font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}.rail.right .option small{font-size:8px;line-height:1.5}.rail.right .option .check{display:none}
 .actions{bottom:111px}.actions .job{font-size:10px;padding:2px 0;margin-bottom:6px;max-width:100%;line-height:1.5}
 .clip-meter{left:22px;right:22px;bottom:345px;font-size:9px;gap:8px}.clip-meter .trackline{min-width:20px}
 .missing{top:230px;bottom:360px;left:22px;right:22px;padding:15px}.missing h2{font-size:18px}.missing p{font-size:10px}.missing small{font-size:9px;margin-top:10px}
 .film-controls{bottom:135px}.steps{bottom:52px}.top .tools{gap:6px}.top button{font-size:10px;padding:8px}
}
@media(max-height:750px) and (min-width:761px){.copy{top:92px}.copy h1,.stage.phase-selection .copy h1,.stage.phase-following .copy h1{font-size:34px;margin:8px 0}.copy p{font-size:12px}.rail{top:34%}.rail .option{min-height:54px;padding-block:8px}.rail.right .option{min-height:58px}.micro{font-size:10px;margin-top:10px}}

</style></head><body>
<header class="top"><div><span class="brand" aria-label="Palm X 文字占位">palm x</span><span class="edition">MATERIAL → OBJECT / CLIP STUDY 03</span></div><div class="tools"><span class="asset-count" id="assetCount">已内嵌 1 个镜头</span><button id="importOpen">补充其他镜头</button><button id="reset">回到开场</button></div></header>
<main><section class="track" id="track" aria-label="材料与完整立体作品的滚动演示"><div class="stage" id="stage"><div class="media" id="media"></div><div class="shade"></div><div class="missing" id="missing" role="status"><span class="slot" id="missingSlot"></span><h2 id="missingTitle"></h2><p id="missingText"></p><small>未接入的阶段不会重复使用开场视频冒充</small></div>
<div class="copy"><div class="eyebrow" id="eyebrow"></div><h1 id="headline"></h1><p id="subline"></p></div><div class="note">已接入你的镜头<br>滚动控制推进 · 向上滚动可回看</div>
<aside class="rail left" id="materials" aria-label="材料视觉选择"><span class="rail-label">01 / MATERIAL</span><button class="option" data-material="wood" aria-pressed="true"><span class="swatch wood"></span><span><b>木材视觉</b><small>WOOD / 待验证</small></span><span class="check">✓</span></button><button class="option" data-material="metal" aria-pressed="false"><span class="swatch metal"></span><span><b>金属视觉</b><small>METAL / 待验证</small></span><span class="check">✓</span></button><p class="micro">当前镜头：金属几何零件。<br>尾帧用于衔接选材布局，不是毛坯。<br>木材、麒麟与激光组合待补素材。</p></aside>
<aside class="rail right" id="projects" aria-label="作品选择"><span class="rail-label">02 / PROJECT</span><button class="option" data-project="sample" aria-pressed="true"><span class="project-number">01</span><span><b>几何零件</b><small>CNC / 当前镜头中的作品</small></span><span class="check">✓</span></button><button class="option" data-project="qilin" aria-pressed="false" disabled title="待补对应素材"><span class="project-number">02</span><span><b>麒麟立体模型</b><small>待补素材 · 保留原方案</small></span><span class="check">✓</span></button><button class="option" data-project="laser" aria-pressed="false" disabled title="待补对应素材"><span class="project-number">03</span><span><b>激光作品</b><small>待补素材 · 独立工艺</small></span><span class="check">✓</span></button></aside>
<div class="actions" id="actions"><div id="ready"><p class="job" id="jobLabel"></p><button class="primary" id="start" disabled>加工镜头待补</button></div><div id="processing" hidden><p class="job" id="processText"></p><div class="bar" role="progressbar" aria-label="影片演示进度，非设备加工进度" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" aria-valuenow="0" id="progressBar"><i id="progressFill"></i></div><button class="link-button" id="processPause">暂停演示</button><button class="link-button" id="skip">跳过加工片段</button></div><div id="finished" hidden><p class="finished-message">当前片段已结束。继续向下，直接衔接作品视频。</p><div class="scroll-indicator" aria-hidden="true">↓</div><button class="link-button" id="again">重新选择 / 再看加工</button></div></div>
<div class="film-controls" id="filmControls" hidden><small id="filmState">进入区域后静音自动播放</small><button class="ghost" id="filmToggle">暂停视频</button></div>
<div class="clip-meter" id="clipMeter"><span id="clipLabel">SCROLL / 镜头 01</span><div class="trackline"><i id="clipFill"></i></div><span id="clipClock">00.00 / 05.00</span></div><div class="steps"><ol aria-label="当前阶段"><li data-step="0"><span>01</span>屏幕</li><li data-step="1"><span>02</span>选材</li><li data-step="2"><span>03</span>加工</li><li data-step="3"><span>04</span>视频</li></ol><span class="hint" id="hint"></span></div><div class="disclaimer"><span>单镜头接入预览 · 原画面与水印保留 · 不连接实体设备</span><span>PALM X / DESIGN REVIEW</span></div></div></section>
<section class="after"><div class="tag">ONE SHOT IN PLACE / 单镜头接入</div><h2>从触摸屏，到作业台。<br>先看这一镜的连续感。</h2><div class="grid"><article><h3>已经替换</h3><p>你提供的“视频节点 4.mp4”已接入屏幕进入现实的开场段。向下滚动推进镜头，向上滚动回看；无需导入，也无需点击转场。</p></article><article><h3>尾帧承接选材界面</h3><p>同一镜头的末帧用于停留与布局评审，不冒充第二段视频或未加工毛坯。当前样例是金属几何零件，不是麒麟模型。其他选项等待对应素材后启用。</p></article><article><h3>后续仍是待补位置</h3><p>粗加工、精加工、成品推进与作品影片尚未接入，不会用这条开场片重复冒充。保留“继续下滚直接进入影片”的结构。右上角可以补充镜头。</p></article></div><p class="micro">视频已内嵌，可离线打开；做了适合滚动定位的编码，原文件未修改，画面未重绘、未调色、未裁去水印。预览静音。后续手动导入的素材只保留在当前浏览器会话。字体使用本机可用字体。</p></section></main>
<dialog id="imports" aria-labelledby="importTitle"><div class="dialog-top"><div><h2 id="importTitle">当前镜头与后续素材位</h2><p id="recipeLabel"></p></div><button class="ghost" id="closeImports">关闭</button></div><p>仅在你的浏览器内读取，不上传。图片 / 视频按当前“材质 + 作品”组合保存于本次会话；其他组合不会挪用这组影片。本次默认“金属视觉 + 几何零件”，只验证已提供镜头；不要把不同造型的影片放进同一组合。</p><div class="batch"><label for="batchFiles">批量导入：文件名以 01_ 到 06_ 开头即可自动匹配</label><input type="file" id="batchFiles" accept="video/*,image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" multiple></div><div class="slots" id="slots"></div><p class="status" id="loadStatus" role="status"></p><p>建议 16:9、同一帧率、无字幕 / 网页按钮；02 可用高清静帧。01、05 用于滚动进度控制，03、04 点击后连续播放，06 滚动进入后自动播放。</p></dialog>
<div class="toast" id="toast" hidden role="status"></div>
<script id="embeddedMedia" type="application/json">{"video":"data:video/mp4;base64,